<h1>提交基因家族(Submit a Genefamily)</h1>

<form>
<table>
<tr><td>名稱(Name)：</td><td> <input name="gfname" size="20" /></td></tr>
<tr><td>描述(Description)：</td><td><input name="gfdesc" size="80" /></td></tr>
<tr><td>成員(Members)：</td><td><textarea cols="30" rows="10" /></textarea></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="2"><input type="submit" value="提交基因家族(submit genefamily)" /></td></tr>
</table>
</form>

